commit 8e9e59ddc0c37ae686ec9c308c5d4ee383c6cdc1

C03: pressing a control inside a messaging client and airplane mode are known unsupported effects (LIMITS1681)

«en Discord apretá enter» and «apretá enviar en WhatsApp» ask to press a control inside a messaging client the product never operates (the visible click works on its own windows; the click reader read the second as a click on the foreground window), and «poneme el modo avión» asks for a switch no operation has (radios are switched one by one). Two known_unsupported_effect_request contracts (client.control.press, network.airplane.mode) close the turn as a plain limit; the click reader excludes a control «en Discord/WhatsApp…» and the direct-request gate sees through that client context.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


